<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PB Market Insights</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#0d1117;
color:#fff;
text-align:center;
}

.hero{
padding:70px 20px;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f2027,#203a43,#2c5364);
}

.hero img{
width:140px;
height:140px;
border-radius:50%;
border:4px solid #00ff99;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:42px;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.hero h2{
color:#00ff99;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero p{
font-size:18px;
max-width:700px;
margin:auto;
line-height:30px;
}

.btn{
display:inline-block;
margin-top:30px;
padding:18px 40px;
background:#00ff99;
color:#000;
text-decoration:none;
font-size:22px;
font-weight:bold;
border-radius:50px;
transition:.3s;
}

.btn:hover{
background:#fff;
transform:scale(1.05);
}

.features{
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
flex-wrap:wrap;
gap:20px;
padding:60px 20px;
}

.card{
background:#161b22;
padding:25px;
width:300px;
border-radius:15px;
box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,255,153,.2);
}

.card h3{
color:#00ff99;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

.card p{
line-height:26px;
}

.footer{
background:#000;
padding:30px;
color:#aaa;
margin-top:50px;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<section class="hero">

<img src="https://i.imgur.com/8Km9tLL.png" alt="Profile">

<h1>PB Market Insights</h1>

<h2>Learn Smart Trading With Confidence</h2>

<p>
📈 Stock Market Analysis<br>
📚 Trading Education<br>
🎯 Price Action Learning<br>
🛡️ Risk Management<br>
🚀 Daily Market Insights
</p>

<a class="btn" href="https://t.me/+3glW3_De2SNlNWU1" target="_blank">
🚀 Join Free Telegram
</a>

</section>

<section class="features">

<div class="card">
<h3>📈 Daily Analysis</h3>
<p>Professional market analysis every trading day.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🎯 Trading Education</h3>
<p>Simple lessons from Beginner to Advanced level.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>💰 Risk Management</h3>
<p>Learn capital protection and smart position sizing.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>🔥 Free Telegram</h3>
<p>Join our free Telegram community and learn daily.</p>
</div>

</section>

<div class="footer">
© 2026 PB Market Insights<br><br>
Educational Purpose Only | Not Financial Advice
</div>

</body>
</html>
